<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs up $0.50-1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 to $1.00 Higher. Demand was moderate to good with a moderate movement. Top $53.50 per cwt.</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  51.50-53.00 Few 51.00 &amp; 53.50</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  45.00-51.00</p>
<p>		210-230 lbs.  40.00-45.00</p>
<p>Sows - firm/up $2.00. Top $49.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-450 lbs. 40.00-44.00 Few 39.00</p>
<p>		450-500 lbs. 44.00-47.00</p>
<p>		500-650 lbs. 46.00-48.00 Over 600 lbs. 49.50</p>
</text>
